	)
	(text "- INA: tied SHUNT-/Scrut- to GND HV (INA GND) for consistent common-mode voltage\n- AMC / TLV: converted differential output to single-ended via differential amp / LPF\n- Scrutineering: SPDT switch, standardized resistors\n- USB: Horizontal footprint, CP2102N GPIO pin for boot\n- MCU: enable bootloader using CP2102N GPIO, MCU GPIO, or switch; diode OR\n- Power: Removed SHDN resistor; fuses for input and isolated DC-DC buck\n- Debug: added VBUS LED, standardized LED resistors\n- Changed to shielded connectors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "980de6b1-021e-4805-af12-9fe27bd69ef2")
	)
	(text "Measures current from battery using low-side shunt resistor\n- Note for charging: max 32A thru Elcon, max 54A to cell\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 102.108 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
